          "anvayaIndex": 7,
          "verseIndex": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.63.4",
      "label": "4.63.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "महाप्रस्थानम् आसाद्य स्वर् गते तु निशाकरे |\nमाम् निर्दहति संतापो वितर्कैः बहुभिः वृतम्",
      "iast": "mahāprasthānam āsādya svar gate tu niśākare |\nmām nirdahati saṃtāpo vitar.hkaiḥ bahubhiḥ vṛtam",
      "translation": "\"But many illogical thoughts crowded round me when Sage Nishaakara has gone on great voyage to heaven, thus my anguish burned me down...",
