      "id": "4.63.5",
      "label": "4.63.5",
      "numbers": [
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "उदिताम् मरणे बुद्धिम् मुनि वाक्यैः निवर्तये |\nबुद्धिः या तेन मे दत्ता प्राणानाम् रक्षणे मम\nसा मे अपनयते दुःखम् दीप्ता इव अग्नि शिखा तमः |",
      "iast": "uditām maraṇe buddhim muni vākyaiḥ nivar.htaye |\nbuddhiḥ yā tena me dattā prāṇānām rakṣaṇe mama\nsā me apanayate duḥkham dīptā iva agni śikhā tamaḥ |",
      "translation": "\"I have been reversing the thought cropped up for my suicide by virtue of the afflatus endowed to me by that sage, and I have been safeguarding my lives as that afflatus is taking away my anguish, as a tongue of flaring fire takes away darkness...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "maraNe uditaam buddhim",
          "iast": "maraṇe uditām buddhim",
          "devanagari": "मरणे उदितां बुद्धिं",
          "meaning": "for dying [suicide,] cropped up, thought",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "muni vaakyaiH nivartaye",
          "iast": "muni vākyaiḥ nivartaye",
          "devanagari": "मुनि वाक्यैः निवर्तये",
          "meaning": "sage, by words of, I am reversing",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 3
